{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_st_10-03","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"st_10-03","title":"理想的倒影","storyCode":"10-18","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_10-03.txt","sourceHash":"54de3f26cb2ccbed5c09a5556606d6dd311748f8f4a2e5b504a949efa5eb1d3f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"進入倫蒂尼姆中央區後，推進之王見到了自救軍貴族派的領袖阿勒黛·坎伯蘭。而在博士的支持下，阿米婭下定決心，準備尋找特蕾西婭復活的真相。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"st03"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜......我還是來晚了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您的意思是，您與我有著相同的遺憾嗎？為了我們沒能在這裡就攔下那些人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"過去......在卡茲戴爾，你和我說話的時候，還不像這樣拘謹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你那時候會直視我的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，當時的卡茲戴爾，還僅僅只是一片雜亂的廢墟，加上一遝厚厚的設計圖而已。那些年裡，您與將軍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，時至今日，已經沒有必要再提那些舊事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您回來了，回到了將軍身邊，你們會一起統率王庭，就像過去無數次那樣，為薩卡茲帶來勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我和其他將士們來說，我們只需要記住這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，曼弗雷德......我是真的很想見見那個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，一個死去的人，還會做夢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的幾個月裡，我常常夢見他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我一遍又一遍地夢見那艘船，夢見我與那位不怎麼愛笑的醫生交談，夢見我與那位寡言少語的指揮官並肩站在甲板上，夢見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......夢見每一個夜晚，我倚在床邊，講著薩卡茲與這片大地的故事，哄那個孩子入睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍......知道這件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"他什麼都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但夢就只是夢......不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，您的臉頰上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......沾上了一些灰燼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不會流淚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我為什麼不會流淚？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g1_shard_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王殿下，你還是讓“她”去了城牆邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你清楚“魔王”的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。無論是曼弗雷德，還是大君，都未必能順利抓住那股力量的繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——要擊敗一個“魔王”，最穩妥的人選自然是另一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你向我提出那個建議的時候，不正是有此打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也記得，當我第一次提議將“她”帶回來的時候，你差點殺死了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“令人作嘔”——你這樣說道。那樣的怒火，我很難忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"我的評價並未改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們依然需要“她”，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有看到你們站在一起，將士們才會願意相信，上一個混亂而黑暗的時代已經結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會再質疑你發出的每一個指令的正當性。薩卡茲的心中，以後都不會再有兩個不同的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為此，我們也必須儘早將另一個“魔王”握在手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去確保這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"將士們必須將注意力集中在眼前的戰爭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"他們該明白，自己追隨的是能率領他們走出困境的君王，而不僅僅只是一股不確定握在誰手中的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道。你向來瞧不上那頂黑色的冠冕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓你滿意，我對“魔王”的研究也從未停止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了“她”，我的確頗有進展。假使接下來我們也能得到那個卡特斯......或許要不了多久，我們就能真正理解“魔王”的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲不該是任何人，任何力量的奴隸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"如果“魔王”的冠冕也是枷鎖——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，打破它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的理想也恰好是我的理想......我會的，攝政王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hall_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到你回來得這麼遲，大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎有一些......疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師，你沒告訴我，女妖也去了那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我還以為你會猜到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖有時候真比食腐者還難纏。那小傢伙的天賦也有些驚人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，再有下次的話，我會把他的舌頭裝在水晶匣裡，作為給他母親的賀禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王殿下和食腐者之王不會喜歡你的這個計畫，大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們就不該知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有曼弗雷德......他竟敢在我頭頂啟動那些城牆上的小玩具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這一身塵土，一半都是因為他。或許我也應當給他一些教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的惱怒，大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，作為對這次情報缺漏的小小補償，我會向攝政王建議，將追捕“魔王”的任務交到你手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那傢伙果然失敗了。我早就跟特雷西斯說過，他就是個心慈手軟的廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，這都在攝政王的計畫之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓那些人為逃過一劫而歡慶吧。想要摧毀一個人的希望與信念，最有效的方式正是令它實現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......城內的貴族們的確又在蠢蠢欲動。你說得對，就讓他們再多做一些蠢事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等宴會到了最高潮，戛然而止的笑語轉變成驚叫，那樣的氣味......才最迷人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，說到貴族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有什麼想報告給攝政王的嗎，大君？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴特雷西斯......我等著下一次宴會開場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明明發現了什麼，卻有意隱瞞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些小動作......攝政王恐怕無法容忍太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城外的公爵軍隊又有什麼動靜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者之王也快回來了。只要他一回來，讓他立刻進城見攝政王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......你不是說，有一位維多利亞的貴族送回來了幾名信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，去見見他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，還有一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然......選擇在這時候回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有什麼打算嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳信去皇家科學院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是時候......來一場久違的家庭聚會了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲......你感覺怎麼樣？會不會趕路趕得太快，有些累？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有哪裡難受的話，一定要告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......胸口好像悶悶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"因為離家越來越近了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那不是家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈......只有你和臨光身邊，才是家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來並不想讓你回到這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我想陪著你，而且......我想找回那些我失去的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我能感覺到，它們就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，夜鶯。我們會找到它，它也會讓你好起來。你一定會好起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候......我們就回羅德島。當然，也可以去卡西米爾......你想去哪裡就去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也會跟我一起去，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"任何時候，只要你希望......我都會在你身旁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......都活下來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，看樣子，我們終於能喘口氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你、你怎麼哭啦？我我我從來沒見你哭過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我只是......我只是想起了比爾，一想到他，我就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比爾......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......咳，不，不行，我不該這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥......還沒結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，洛洛，我們現在很安全，我們可以停下來，想一想老比爾，想一想其他朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下一場戰鬥開始之前，這是我們的權利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於見到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛·坎伯蘭。叫我阿勒黛就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是克洛維希婭的朋友，倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍在奧克特里格區——也就是大家所說的中央區的負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......坎伯蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是坎伯蘭公爵的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而父親去世的時候，我也還只是個小孩子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只記得他每次劍術比賽結束後，非要用汗津津的鬍子蹭我的臉——二十多年過去，這是僅剩的一點回憶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，坎伯蘭公爵......是被其他反對王室的公爵們謀害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親是為了他的理想，走上了他心中唯一正確的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很佩服他，這也是為何我會在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和城內其他貴族......你們也一直在努力與薩卡茲對抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不過，我們的努力才剛剛讓事情有了一些起色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊莎貝爾來找我的時候，我真的很驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅僅由於她是曼徹斯特伯爵的繼承人——雖然伯爵一直是我們最堅實的後盾之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我本以為塔樓騎士已經全部犧牲......伊莎貝爾的歸來對我們很多人來說，都是莫大的鼓舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，最讓我驚喜的，還是......你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我原本並不清楚，不然怎麼能叫“驚喜”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年，我們沒有停止過尋找你的下落，但從未有過任何線索。有很多人認為你早已死去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，想找我的人裡，大部分是想殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可即便這部分人裡，也有相當多已經改變了主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看到了如今的倫蒂尼姆——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們早已失去了自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何維多利亞人，哪怕是依然保留著封號的貴族們，也都要嘛成了薩卡茲的奴隸，要嘛正在為了能活到第二天而戰戰兢兢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕他們在深夜做夢的時候，嘴裡都會喊著“陛下”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試問誰沒有想過，假設沒有當年那場突如其來的絞刑，倫蒂尼姆還會不會是今日的光景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真覺得我在這裡，就能改變現狀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我們多了一種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你看起來仍在思索，但我知道你已經下定了決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你派伊莎貝爾來聯絡我，難道不正是說明，你做好了帶領我們抗擊薩卡茲的準備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認，我確實做出了一個決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是準備......準備是永遠做不完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該開始了，阿勒黛小姐......阿勒黛。請再介紹一下我們目前的情況吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚，我要補的功課有點多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我喜歡你的幹勁。這正是我們所需要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回家，亞歷山德莉娜......殿下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希......呼，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——想見你一面，還是很難啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你出來的時候，有沒有人跟著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，這一路上的痕跡我都仔細處理過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連這都做不好的話，我怎麼能做你的信使呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經做得夠好了。你的父親也會為你驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，在過去很多次，我以為我會失敗的時候......我都忍不住想，如果你在的話，你會怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想過，等我帶著大家一起挺過去，你又會怎麼說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是此時此刻，你真的站在我面前，我突然覺得，我想像中的那些言語都無所謂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，你確實準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......我會一直準備著。我們都會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你急著去見阿米婭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我確認過，她目前很安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很久沒回倫蒂尼姆了，我還有一些事需要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一個人......她一直在等著見你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，解釋一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這次你又想讓我解釋什麼，W？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是這麼冷靜。我竟然無法判斷，在來之前，你究竟知不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，比起我的問題的答案來說，你是不是個怪物壓根無關緊要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭......那真的是特蕾西婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你怎麼能讓她的身體落到特雷西斯手裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，博士，我沒注意到你走近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自從下了列車，你就心事重重的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在車上到底看見了什麼？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有辦法瞞著你......也不該瞞著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我看見了......她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......洛洛小姐說的，原來真的是她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希說她已經......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"凱爾希說是我......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有W對我的態度......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在四年前，特蕾西婭小姐已經死去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然關於這件事情背後的真相，凱爾希醫生、W小姐或許和我有不同的看法......但有一個事實，我們都不會弄錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一天，我們的確失去了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那究竟是怎麼回事......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......在車站看到她的那一刻，我終於明白......為什麼我會在倫蒂尼姆感受到那樣的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了憤怒以外......還有悲傷。無窮無盡的悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......對薩卡茲來說，憤怒和悲傷從來都是共生的，只是他們大部分時候選擇用怒火焚乾淚水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這全部的情感，都像是凝聚在她的眼睛裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是過去的特蕾西婭小姐，她也不曾......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很痛苦。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦嗎？也許，但這比起他們......那些被憎恨與偏見逼得粉身碎骨的薩卡茲來說，並不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到的......還是太少，太少了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過瞥到了一瞬間，那樣洶湧的情感就差點淹沒了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那特蕾西婭小姐又遭遇了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這不是你的責任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我之前說過，我無法想像那真的是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......當我親眼看到她的時候，我發現接受自己所見的，並沒有那麼難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我來到了這裡，那我就需要弄清楚真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅是關於特蕾西婭小姐的真相，還有城內的薩卡茲......他們到底經歷了什麼，才會有那麼多的憤怒與悲傷？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果真相會帶來更多痛苦呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以感到害怕，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也害怕，阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但我們會一起走下去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我們一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去找答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這也是我想要的答案。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，請原諒我打擾你們的交談——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一件事，對亞歷山德莉娜......我是說維娜，和我們自救軍來說非常重要且緊急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據海蒂女士發來的信件，我們確定了這件事只能找您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛德華·雅特利亞斯的遺物，目前是否在您手中？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep10"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["？？？","凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜鶯"]}]}
